Welcome to one of the FINEST homes in the Country Club at River Hall! Perfectly located just minutes from the clubhouse, this Pallazio floor plan by Taylor Morrison offers 3 bedrooms plus a den, 3 full bathrooms, and OVER 3,000 sqft of thoughtfully designed living space. With tile and luxury vinyl plank flooring throughout, this home is LOADED WITH UPGRADES and ready for its new owners! As you pull into the pavered driveway, you'll immediately notice the mature landscaping, modern light fixtures, and CUSTOM garage door. Step through the double front doors with a transom window into a bright foyer accented by wainscoting and CROWN MOLDING that flows throughout the home. To your right, the guest suite offers privacy with its own EN-SUITE bath, featuring a walk-in shower and vanity, ideal for visitors. Across the hall, the den with double French doors, custom shelving, and a Murphy bed adds flexible living space for a home office or extra guests. Continue into the OPEN-CONCEPT main living area, where natural light fills the space. The dining area is accented by custom mirrors, while the living room showcases TRAY CEILINGS, and wide-plank luxury vinyl flooring. The kitchen is light and bright, featuring white shaker cabinets, a beautiful tile backsplash, granite countertops, stainless steel appliances with matching hood vent, oversized island, and a walk-in pantry! This space was designed for entertaining, and more importantly, effortless everyday living. The primary suite, tucked away for privacy, boasts an IMPRESSIVE SIZE. It includes tray ceilings, a large walk-in closet with custom shelving, and a luxurious double-entry shower with multiple shower heads, including a rainfall feature. Dual vanities, a makeup counter, and a private water closet complete the suite. Step through the sliding glass doors to the screened lanai, the true CENTERPIECE of this home's design. Enjoy a heated pool and spa, OUTDOOR FIREPLACE, and a fully equipped OUTDOOR KITCHEN with propane grill, hood vent, and rock backsplash, perfect for year-round Florida living. ADDITIONAL HIGHLIGHTS include custom shelving in all closets, surround sound speakers throughout, a laundry room with a utility sink and overhead cabinets, and side-by-side washer and dryer, plus a garage with overhead storage racks for convenience. Enjoy the 18-hole championship golf course designed by Davis Love III and experience resort-style living at its finest - all with low golf and HOA fees! The community offers a lakeside pool with a Tiki Bar and restaurant, a separate golf clubhouse with its own dining, a resort-style pool, full fitness center, pickleball and tennis courts, an on-site elementary school, and a brand-new fire station for added peace of mind. This home perfectly balances elegance, comfort, and functionality. Centrally located with easy access to Palm Beach and I-75, providing a straight shot to Downtown Fort Myers, RSW Airport, & SWFL dining and shopping. The only thing missing is YOU!

